@page "/"

<PageTitle>QuantSaaS Dashboard</PageTitle>

<h1>QuantSaaS</h1>

<div class="alert alert-info">
    <strong>Status:</strong> SaaS server is running.
    Connect your LocalAgent to begin live trading.
</div>

<h2>Getting Started</h2>
<ol>
    <li>Register or log in via <code>POST /api/v1/auth/register</code></li>
    <li>Configure your LocalAgent with your credentials and exchange API keys</li>
    <li>Start the LocalAgent — it will connect automatically via WebSocket</li>
    <li>Create a strategy instance and start it to begin automated trading</li>
</ol>

<h2>API Endpoints</h2>
<ul>
    <li><code>POST /api/v1/auth/register</code> — Create account</li>
    <li><code>POST /api/v1/auth/login</code> — Get JWT token</li>
    <li><code>WS /ws/agent</code> — LocalAgent WebSocket connection</li>
</ul>
